                        "entry_id": "4738a271-3a17-3ab9-a26f-08a7390b78d1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "diminutive of су́ка (súka): bitch (literal and abusive senses)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "diminutive",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "6dbd8411-2bbf-4e87-b0cd-54450242bf74",
                                "sense_id": "c62e8a6e-3050-3e50-bbd0-d90d2d6671ad",
                                "text": "— Я сейча́с и́з-за тебя́ чуть кага́на не уби́л, крети́н, — заора́л я. — Я ещё и твои́х су́чек до́лжен пасти́?",
                                "translation": "‘I just almost killed the Kagan because of you, you cretin,’ I roared. ‘And I’m supposed to look out for your little bitches?’",
                                "english": "‘I just almost killed the Kagan because of you, you cretin,’ I roared. ‘And I’m supposed to look out for your little bitches?’"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
